# Core Philosophy

Test-driven, security-first. Delegate per fable-orchestration; trivial work stays in the main loop.

---

## Agents and review

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Trace unfamiliar code before touching it | `Explore` agent (`model: 'sonnet'`) |
| Review after every implementation lane, before commit | `mattpocock-skills:code-review` (standards + spec), or `/code-review` for a bug hunt |
| Test-first feature or bug fix | `mattpocock-skills:tdd` |
| Hard bug, flaky failure, regression | `mattpocock-skills:diagnosing-bugs` |
| Change touching auth, customer data, payments, external API keys | `/security-review` before commit |
| Library/API question | context7 MCP |

