# fable-orchestration
- **fable-orchestration** (`~/.claude/skills/fable-orchestration/SKILL.md`) - main loop Opus 5.5 owns judgment, specs and synthesis. Sonnet 5.5 agents by default for context gathering and code writing; Opus 5.5 agents for important/architectural/risky changes and every review round. Parallel write lanes get disjoint OWNS lists. Always stamp `model:` explicitly.
Whenever the task needs sub-agents or substantial research or code, load this skill before doing anything else.
